<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3Com restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it reinstated coverage of 3Com Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- 3Com was off 1-7/8 to 47-7/8.</p>
</text>
